From 67b383b4d0e6b0e6fa289c64479a452da9394c7d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 01:30:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] test(kanban): harden retirement custody and CAS proofs
 [daveey]

Fail closed on identity-incomplete synced stores; use keyset ranges instead of sorting a computed cursor key. Cover each selector CAS atom, a second-connection set-model at the transaction boundary, committed notification readback, all supported line separators and missing synced identity.

Proof: 42 focused tests pass. Exact-anchor mutation baseline passes; 16 guard mutations killed, covering all selector CAS atoms, terminal/home/body custody, class/auto preservation, mandatory state, missing identity, dry dispatch, rotation and body evidence. Canonical review and required CI remain mandatory.
